%% UC-40 — Explore product analytics
%% Sources: mobile/lib/analytics/, app/services/productAnalyticsService.js,
%% monitoring/render-traefik.sh + monitoring/traefik/*.tmpl, analytics-vm/
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant M as Flutter app
    participant A as AnalyticsService
    participant T as habitvm Traefik
    participant PH as PostHog (private VM)
    participant K as Kafka
    participant CH as ClickHouse
    actor R as Researcher (TU/VPN)

    P->>M: Complete an instrumented action
    M->>A: capture(allowlisted event, controlled properties)
    A->>A: Validate name, keys and values
    A->>A: Add study/group, app, platform, locale, schema
    alt analytics configuration is blank
        A-->>M: No-op; participant flow continues
    else configured
        A->>T: POST /ingest/batch/
        T->>T: Match ingest allowlist, rate-limit, strip /ingest
        T->>PH: POST /batch/ over private network
        PH->>K: Queue event
        K->>CH: Persist event
    end
    R->>PH: Open private UI over TU network/VPN
    PH->>CH: Query pseudonymous funnel
    CH-->>PH: Aggregated results
    PH-->>R: Funnel / breakdown by study and group
